From b8d5748347e4722c73fed6b5841f96d0df189217 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mason Freed <masonf@chromium.org>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 14:02:30 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] [Backport] CVE-2026-121182: Use after free in DOM

Manual backport assisted by Claude Code of patch originally
reviewed on https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8634694:
Fix UAF in TransitionPseudoElementData::ClearPseudoElements

Move transition_containers_ into a local map before disposing entries
in TransitionPseudoElementData::ClearPseudoElements, and release
column_pseudo_elements_ and transition_data_ before clearing them in
PseudoElementData::ClearPseudoElements so re-entrant lookups or
mutations cannot invalidate an active iterator.

Also prevent PseudoElements from being registered in TreeScope ID or
name maps in Element::UpdateId and Element::UpdateName, and ensure
HitTestResult::GetPosition uses inner_node_ rather than a PseudoElement
when ChildPaintBlockedByDisplayLock is true.

Fixed: 576169244
Bug: 576169244
Change-Id: I3d412dd2defa1eb3149d1d1fa254a8a367571f4c
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8634694
Reviewed-by: Noam Rosenthal <nrosenthal@google.com>
Auto-Submit: Mason Freed <masonf@chromium.org>
Commit-Queue: Noam Rosenthal <nrosenthal@google.com>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1726202}
Reviewed-on: https://codereview.qt-project.org/c/qt/qtwebengine-chromium/+/786824
Reviewed-by: Allan Sandfeld Jensen <allan.jensen@qt.io>
